# NOTICE

magpie-android is an **unofficial** Android host for [yetone/magpie](https://github.com/yetone/magpie).
It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by the magpie project.

## What this repository contains

Only the Android host is published here: ~1.2 k lines of Java, resources, build
scripts and documentation. **No magpie source code is vendored.** The engine is
compiled from the upstream repository at build time (see `docs/zh/02-build.md`).

